    "created_at": "2016-09-14T08:11:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-14T08:11:14Z",
    "body": "Well, HTML says \"When an element is added to the pending dialog stack, it must also be added to the top layer. When an element is removed from the pending dialog stack, it must be removed from the top layer.\" without using Fullscreen's (new) add/remove definitions.\n\nHow about exporting only add/remove and treating top layer itself as an internal concept?\n",
